spice
* SPICE Netlist
VDD VDD 0 DC <voltage_value>
* Resistors
RD VDD Vout <RD_value>
RG Vin M1_gate <RG_value>
* Transistors
M1 M1_drain M1_gate 0 0 NMOS
M2 Vout Vb M2_source 0 NMOS
* Net Connections
* Node Mappings
M1_drain = 0
? Missing component
M1_source = 0
M2_drain = Vout
M2_gate = Vb
M2_source = M1_drain
* End of Netlist
